# Squirming Emergence judges its target again as it resolves, against the number of permanent cards in the graveyard then (CR 608.2b,
# the ruling). Turn 1: Thought Scour mills Grizzly Bears and Plains, two permanent cards. Turn 3: Squirming Emergence targets the Bears (mana
# value 2, at most the two counted), and Bot2's Scavenging Ooze exiles the Plains in response: one permanent card is left, fewer than the
# Bears' value, so the target is illegal and the spell does nothing. The Bears stay in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Island
Thought Scour
Squirming Emergence
Grizzly Bears
Plains
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Gleemox
Scavenging Ooze
Island x20

